  "description": "Five-phase bench rig (Plant.Inverter.Leg5ph 5-leg bridge + Plant.Machine.Pmsm5ph, Clarke-5 dq + z1/z2 plane integration) on the gen7 'Size 2' bench chain: dyno hold, knee-class distortion per leg, 19.8 mF CV-supplied DC link, loss/thermal/sensor views, fault point. Legs D/E are optional unwired inputs, driven by the host per control period via the plant-input external (arg=Dd=../De=..), same seam as InductDq.Omega_Cmd; phases A-C of the meas chain carry three of the five machine phases (3-phase measurement vocabulary). Model simplifications are documented in Assets/PlantTemplates/Plant.Machine.Pmsm5ph/PROVENANCE.md (z-plane rotor coupling neglected, star point ideal, Lz calibration gap). Registry status: plant node kinds live in the engines' classify tables (C++ PlantGenerator + twin NODE_CLASSES, contract D3); this wave ships assets only, so closed-loop rte sim waits on the one registry line per engine (kind-in-schema, twin ROADMAP M6).",
